    <p class="tag">Specialised Service</p>
    <h1>Unsure About Your Immigration Status?</h1>

    <p>If you are uncertain about the validity of your stay, visa status, extensions, or immigration records in the Philippines, you may request a confidential preliminary assessment before personally attending a Bureau of Immigration office.</p>

    <p>Provide the relevant details and supporting passport information requested by our team. We can review the available information, explain the appropriate next steps, and, where the applicable procedure allows representation or document processing on your behalf, assist with the relevant immigration transaction.</p>

    <p>Where an original travel document is required, specific submission, handling and return instructions will be provided.</p>

    <div class="notice-box">
      <p>This service does not provide protection from arrest, detention or deportation, does not involve concealment from any government authority, and does not guarantee a particular outcome, a specific regularisation result, or that personal appearance before the Bureau of Immigration will never be required. Every situation is assessed individually.</p>
    </div>

    <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Send an Enquiry</a></p>
